stateDiagram-v2
direction LR

[*] --> Logged_Out

state "Logged Out" as Logged_Out
state "Login Screen" as Login_Screen
state "Invalid Login" as Invalid_Login
state "Authenticated Employee" as Auth_Employee
state "Authenticated Manager" as Auth_Manager
state "Dashboard" as Dashboard
state "Item Lookup" as Item_Lookup
state "View Product Details" as View_Product_Details
state "Product Voiding" as Product_Voiding
state "Product Voided" as Product_Voided
state "Access Denied" as Access_Denied
state "Start Sale" as Start_Sale
state "Product Scanned" as Product_Scanned
state "Cart Updated" as Cart_Updated
state "Sale Blocked" as Sale_Blocked
state "Payment Processing" as Payment_Processing
state "Transaction Complete" as Transaction_Complete
state "Reports" as Reports
state "Logout" as Logout

Logged_Out --> Login_Screen : open app
Login_Screen --> Invalid_Login : bad id/password
Invalid_Login --> Login_Screen : retry

Login_Screen --> Auth_Manager : valid login && PID startsWith("M")
Login_Screen --> Auth_Employee : valid login && other PID

Auth_Manager --> Dashboard
Auth_Employee --> Dashboard

Dashboard --> Item_Lookup : lookup item
Item_Lookup --> View_Product_Details : product found
View_Product_Details --> Item_Lookup : search again

View_Product_Details --> Product_Voiding : manager clicks "Void Product"
Product_Voiding --> Product_Voided : void saved (isVoided=true)
Product_Voided --> Item_Lookup : show void status

View_Product_Details --> Access_Denied : employee attempts voiding
Access_Denied --> Dashboard

Dashboard --> Start_Sale : make sale
Start_Sale --> Product_Scanned : add item by SKU/name
Product_Scanned --> Sale_Blocked : product.isVoided == true
Sale_Blocked --> Start_Sale : choose another product
Product_Scanned --> Cart_Updated : product valid and sellable
Cart_Updated --> Product_Scanned : scan next item
Cart_Updated --> Payment_Processing : complete sale
Payment_Processing --> Transaction_Complete : transaction saved
Transaction_Complete --> Dashboard : sale complete

Dashboard --> Reports : open reports
Reports --> Dashboard : back to dashboard

Dashboard --> Logout : logout action
Logout --> Logged_Out : session cleared
